\newlabel{tab:layerwise}{{3}{5}{Effect of adding gradient accumulation layers incrementally (from shallow to deeper layers) throughout the deep network. The numbers reported are the classification accuracy using the VGG network on the CIFAR-10 dataset. Baseline performance is 89.4\%. \textit  {conv1 to} indicates we start adding the gradient accumulation layers from \textit  {conv1} upto the mentioned layers such as \textit  {pool1}, \textit  {pool2} etc.}{}{}}
